        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-proximal"
      },
      "id": 9,
      "description": "Confirmed-dead uncontrolled terminations. The confirmed-dead classes only (agent_pid_dead, agent_exited_unsealed, recovery_exhausted); liveness_deadline_missed is excluded by design (F-A6).",
